  "details": "I have a few old non-humanoid SDK2 avatars that are essentially dumb 3D models with no armature imported as Generic into Unity.\nSince the PhysBone update, these fail to load in both the avatar preview and the in-game.\nThe VRChat log provides a useful Exception that seems to point to the lack of an animator being a problem in the PhysBone conversion script (note these avatars do not contain any bones, let alone PhysBones):\n```2022.04.22 11:44:10 Exception  -  Object reference not set to an instance of an object.\n  at VRC.SDK3.Dynamics.PhysBone.PhysBoneMigration.Convert (UnityEngine.Animator animator, System.Collections.Generic.List`1[T] dbList, System.Collections.Generic.List`1[T] dbcList) [0x00000] in <00000000000000000000000000000000>:0```",
  "error": null,
